            "review_title": "Review at Phở An - Vietnamese Food & Drinks",
            "review_text": "PickardCJ\nBrisbane, Australia17 contributions\n0\nDefinitely worth a try\nMar 2026 • Solo\nThe stewed beef in wine pho was amazing. Super fresh, lots of herbs etc to accompany. The fried dough sticks for dipping are a must!\nBe sure to use the table condiments to tailor your soup: pickled garlic, fish sauce, chilli sauce etc. Makes a lovely dish even better.\nSuper well priced and great service by friendly staff\nWritten March 10, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
