            "review_title": "Review at Phở An - Vietnamese Food & Drinks",
            "review_text": "Kellie V.\nDa Nang, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nGood restaurant!!!\nJul 2025 • Family\nDelicious pho and flavorful meat, the broth is the best part: no added MSG (which I'm allergic to). Prices are very reasonable. The restaurant is simple but clean, spacious, and airy. Free iced tea, fresh chili, and herbs come with each meal. Being a new place, it’s still not widely known, but it's easy to find on Google Maps.\nInsider tip:\ntry Beef stew noodle soup\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 6, 2025",
